{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Platformer/Shooter inspired by the PS2 Ratchet and Clank Games! A True Love letter to the PS2 Era!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the Demo version of this game you can explore 2 complete worlds from the game, try 4 of the weapons, and get a great taste of the story!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Worlds include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earth+ a city in the sky above Earth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxium, a Tropical planet turned into a scenic resort(minus the violent locals)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXPLORE SPACE AND DISCOVER NEW WORLDS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689880/extras/gif_3.gif?t=1746504440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel the galaxy exploring all sorts of new worlds all controlled by the galXE Corporation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the lush jungles and white sand beaches of Relaxium(just watch out for the local population kidnapping tourists and forcing them to fight in a combat arena)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689880/extras/gif_5.gif?t=1746504440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or the busy city skyline of Earth+ where striking robot union members make buisness hard to do</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689880/extras/gif_6.gif?t=1746504440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRY OUT FUTURISTIC NEW WEAPONS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out many of galXE's new weapons including The Fister 5000! Great for any situation.. like if you want to punch someone in front of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689880/extras/gif_4.gif?t=1746504440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your weapons and be as strong as you can be! Cause chaos with wild effects at level 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689880?t=1746504440","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689880?t=1746504440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689880/11f51387998a40c9b59d772c163913c975299484/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746504440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689880/11f51387998a40c9b59d772c163913c975299484/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746504440","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Platformer/Shooter inspired by the PS2 Ratchet and Clank Games! A True Love letter to the PS2 Era!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the Demo version of this game you can explore 2 complete worlds from the game, try 4 of the weapons, and g